    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your own epic fantasy quest to restore colour and life to a forgotten and abandoned world. Solve puzzles and learn about real life strategies for managing anxiety taught in a fun and engaging way. Developed alongside a practising psychologist, Taming Yore Dragon innovates and expands on what videogames can achieve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue and join forces with a diverse cast of characters who provide valuable insights and help with your journey along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267650/extras/2c4b351d00ac1fa8931f5f56f521b470.avif?t=1743600543\" width=700 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267650/extras/41828dc30a7a53f814c2d44f966cfe59.poster.avif?t=1743600543\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267650/extras/41828dc30a7a53f814c2d44f966cfe59.webm?t=1743600543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267650/extras/1ee6b4feda5027cccdb67a053aa652b8.avif?t=1743600543\" width=700 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267650/extras/1ba7efa4d04c69bf663a810699d240a7.poster.avif?t=1743600543\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267650/extras/1ba7efa4d04c69bf663a810699d240a7.webm?t=1743600543\" type=\"video